# Context

## Why This Way
The V0.8.1 kit prose taught count-tier equipment bonuses, a
first-claim Prestige reward, response-turn acclamation, and officials
on the Peristyle - all changed or removed by the 0.9.x line. The kit's
own guard (PRINTED_RULES_VALUES) refused to build against v092 until
the prose matched, which is by design.

## Gotchas
- The duel boost is NOT cut in v092: the engine reads
  succession.challenge_bonus (still 2). combat.challenge_bonus is a
  dead key. Zeroing it (as the v0.9.1 trim did) changes nothing, so
  the kit keeps the boost text. See the fork report.
- Movement is the SUM of two dice as the step budget (engine:
  current_roll = sum(current_dice)), not the higher die.
- "proclaim_cost" is absent in v092; the engine reads absent cost
  keys as free, so the pin loop treats absent-as-zero.

